      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "That wouldn't be feasible, as VRChat would virtually turn your phone into a portable hand warmer. Phones are terrible at distributing the heat that would be produced from running VRChat and still wouldn't work because of the lack of a proper controller scheme, let alone the fact that simply running the world would reduce the frames to an unplayable level itself.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
